'''Sparkle7''' is a [[common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually for 200 [[coins]] {{Currency|Old Coin}} in the [[Sparkle Time Pack]], or by purchasing the whole pack. It is now only obtainable through trading as the pack has since been removed from the shop.   

== Appearance ==
Sparkle7 has a sparkly blade, hence the name, with many geometrical shapes varying in different shades of red. It has a silver guard, and a solid black handle.

==Trivia==
*It is the seventh out of the 10 knives in the [[Sparkle Time Pack]].

